         fhir:comment [ fhir:v "Element `Measure.topic` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Measure.topic` as `Equivalent`.\nElement `Measure.topic` has been flagged as deprecated.\nDEPRECATION NOTE: For consistency, implementations are encouraged to migrate to using the new 'topic' code in the useContext element.  (I.e. useContext.code indicating http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/usage-context-type#topic and useContext.valueCodeableConcept indicating the topic)" ]
