         fhir:comment [ fhir:v "Element `Measure.group.scoring` has a context of Measure.group based on following the parent source element upwards and mapping to `Measure`.\nElement `Measure.group.scoring` has no mapping targets in FHIR R4. Typically, this is because the element has been added (is a new element).\nWhen specified at the group level, defines the scoring for this specific group. If not specified, scoring for this group is determined by the root scoring element" ]
